  "substantive_research": [
    "Prior primary1910arrangement/1911Belgian law and1965StateDepartment IBS51 establish historical median-line context. The1965position uncertainty is dated to materials reviewed then; it is not a current legal-status finding. These retained reads are reused with their scope limits, not rerun or claimed newly performed.",
