    "Exact TZAADM1original archive, DBF/XML/license and earlier4.0version inspected.2015represented source is OSM/Wambacher;2017attributeprocessing is not survey date. Original threefieldDBF has no OSMrelation/version/exportsettings. Exporter2019documented optional land clipping but historical selected setting remains unknown; lake relation1374224is a clipping input, not an administrative median relation.",
    "COD2019original target archive explicitly documents OCHAatlas digitization, watercourse splitting, topology/naming/IMWG checks and later field changes. It supplies no exact lake median, target-specific atlas sheet/control points or rule proving that a lake edge was reconstructed. Watercourse splitting is not assumed to construct lake medians.",
    "Exactkey[14461,137123,153506] has onlyRukwa negative0 / feature15 interior membership; all11others, including allZMBoperands andKatavi, are explicitly empty. Rukwa is now native attribution, not only a centre-label inference.",
    "Southern tripoint context was separately investigated: actualSI53/2012Nsama route follows theDRCboundary to tri-statepoint then approximately39km towardCapeNundo. It supplies relative route but not adopted coordinate/datum. It does not makeZMBan active native exclusion here.",
    "Official2009ZambiaParliamentanswer384 actually read:1989treaty treated as agreed boundary while physical demarcation remained pending; minister said noDRCvalidityquery received as of2009. ACP2021confirms18September1989treaty context. Prior academictranscription has signedmapsI/II provision but is not a certifiedoriginal.",
    "OfficialHansard/ministerialcatalogues actually inspected: relevant chronological list jumps2006to2002, with no accessible2004statement link. BoundedofficialUN/gazette inquiries did not locate a treaty/annex identifier; unsupportedUNTSform paused, not falsely counted as queried."
  ],
